    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24500" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interŭlus</span></b> , a, um, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adj. dim.</i>
			[inter], <i>inward</i>, <i>inner</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nexus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 9, § 888</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tunica,</span>”
				<i>under-garment</i>, <i>shirt</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">App. Flor. 9</span></i>
			. — Also, <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">intĕrŭla</span></b> ,
				ae, f., <i><span class="en">App. M.
				8, p. 205, 16</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interulae dilores duae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vop. Bonos. 15, 8</span></i>
			.</div>
